{"id":"babadag","qid":"Q4074121","category":"mountain","type":"oronym","names":{"az":"Babadağ","ru":"Бабадаг","en":"Babadağ"},"coordinates":[48.3042,41.02],"coordinatesSource":"wd","region":"dagliq-sirvan","regionSource":"wp-az","admin":[],"firstRecord":null,"period":null,"forms":[],"namedAfter":[],"etymology":[{"lang":"az","heading":"Adının mənası","text":"Babadağ oronimi Azərbaycan dilindəki \"baba\" (hörmət bildirən titul mənasında) sözündəndir.>.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-az","anchor":"Adının_mənası"},{"lang":"ru","heading":"Этимология","text":"Тюркское и иранское слово баба означает «отец», но может употребляться и в значениях «дед», «прадед», даг — тюрк. гора, то есть название Бабадаг — «отец-гора», «дед-гора».","truncated":false,"source":"wp-ru","anchor":"Этимология"}],"summary":{"az":{"text":"Babadağ — Quba və İsmayıllı rayonu ərazisində yerləşən, Böyük Qafqaz dağlarının cənub şərqində qərar tutan ən hündür zirvələrindən biri, ziyarətgah.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-az"},"ru":{"text":"Бабадаг (азерб. Babadağ — «дед-гора») — горная вершина в Губинском районе Азербайджана, на востоке Водораздельного хребта Большого Кавказа, близ истоков реки Карачай. Наряду с этим, у подножия горы Бабадаг берут свое начало реки Гёйчай, Гирдыманчай, Бабачай. Высота — 3629,6 метров.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-ru"},"en":{"text":"Babadağ is a mountain in Ismayilli District, Azerbaijan. It is considered a sacred site. pilgrims make the long trek to the summit from Babadağ base camp at the foot of the mountain. The route to the summit is steep and there are a number of false summits. Babadag has been under state protection as a monument of national historical and cultural significance since the decision of the Cabinet of Ministers of Azerbaijan dated August 2, 2001.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-en"}},"images":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Babadag.jpg/960px-Babadag.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","small":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Babadag.jpg/960px-Babadag.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","width":800,"height":533,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Babadag.jpg","title":"Babadag.jpg","artist":"Lyokin http://Lyokin.com https://www.panoramio.com/photo/118451759","credit":"https://www.panoramio.com/photo/118451759","license":"GFDL","licenseUrl":"http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/fdl.html","source":"img-1"}],"sources":[{"id":"wd","kind":"wikidata","title":"Wikidata Q4074121: Babadağ","publisher":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q4074121","licence":"CC0 1.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Babadağ (dağ, Azərbaycan)","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Babada%C4%9F_(da%C4%9F%2C_Az%C9%99rbaycan)&oldid=8683329","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/Babada%C4%9F_(da%C4%9F%2C_Az%C9%99rbaycan)","revid":8683329,"revDate":"2026-03-12","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-ru","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"ru","title":"Бабадаг (гора, Азербайджан)","publisher":"Википедия (на русском)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%D0%91%D0%B0%D0%B1%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B0%D0%B3_(%D0%B3%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B0%2C_%D0%90%D0%B7%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B1%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%B4%D0%B6%D0%B0%D0%BD)&oldid=153676731","pageUrl":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%91%D0%B0%D0%B1%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B0%D0%B3_(%D0%B3%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B0%2C_%D0%90%D0%B7%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B1%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%B4%D0%B6%D0%B0%D0%BD)","revid":153676731,"revDate":"2026-06-24","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-en","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"en","title":"Babadağ (Azerbaijan)","publisher":"Wikipedia (English)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Babada%C4%9F_(Azerbaijan)&oldid=1368605305","pageUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Babada%C4%9F_(Azerbaijan)","revid":1